summary.label:
Create live-photo, GIF and videos with your photos!

You can:
* Modify the gradient border animation color;
* Set your photo or predefined background to animate borders around;
* Create live photos;
* Create GIFs;
* Create videos;
* Export them in your photo gallery;
* Use the live photo as wallpaper for your iPhone;
* Tap and hold your desk to see your live photo goes live!
